--[[
MOHG, LORD OF BLOOD

In the elder days, when kingdoms yet stood and the world was young,
there arose a lord beneath the earth. His name was Mohg,
and blood was his crown. From shadow he watched the realms of men,
gathering power in silence, until his name became a whisper spoken
only by those who feared what dwelt below.

---

The only reason the source is obfuscated is because the ENTIRETY
of the code is original, believe it or not.

Even though it is AI-generated (let's be honest, maybe 75-80%),
I had to fix, improve, and rewrite a lot of the code myself,
as well as create entire systems from scratch.

I don't care if this is ever deobfuscated. If you are reading this
with plans to deobfuscate it, I sincerely beg you:

Please do not leak the infinite ammo exploit.

Sincerely,

* Damix2131

Contact: @infyiff on Discord
Or join the Meowhg Discord server at:
https://discord.gg/gfuq4FSspr

Also, I rate Blood Zone 10/10, as someone who has spent
80+ hours on the game (ghost cheating) and made this entire script.

Thank you, reader.

Credits to Kio and Q33A for testing my script.
Y'all are the best <3
]]
